From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 14:56:04 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] hermes: 0173 resumed subagents run under their chat's yolo

A subagent the next gateway resumed after a restart handoff re-arms its chat's persisted /yolo, which only the chat's next turn restored before.
---
